:HELP NAME=ADDSVRAUTE.Add Server Auth Entry (ADDSVRAUTE)
:P.The Add Server Auth Entry (ADDSVRAUTE) command works with a user and
password a profile uses on a remote server.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='ADDSVRAUTE/USRPRF'.User profile (USRPRF)
:P.The user profile the command uses.
:P.A value is required.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK.*CURRENT:EPK.
:PD.The current one.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='ADDSVRAUTE/SERVER'.Server (SERVER)
:P.The server for this command.
:P.A value is required.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.character-value:EPV.
:PD.Type up to 200 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='ADDSVRAUTE/USRID'.User ID (USRID)
:P.The user ID for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*USRPRF:EPK.
:PD.The value of the user profile the job runs under.
:PT.:PV.character-value:EPV.
:PD.Type up to 1000 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='ADDSVRAUTE/PASSWORD'.User password (PASSWORD)
:P.The password.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:PT.:PV.character-value:EPV.
:PD.Type up to 128 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=CHGSVRAUTE.Change Server Auth Entry (CHGSVRAUTE)
:P.Use the Change Server Auth Entry (CHGSVRAUTE) command to change the
user or password of a server entry.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGSVRAUTE/USRPRF'.User profile (USRPRF)
:P.The user profile the command uses.
:P.A value is required.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK.*CURRENT:EPK.
:PD.The current one.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGSVRAUTE/SERVER'.Server (SERVER)
:P.The server for this command.
:P.A value is required.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.character-value:EPV.
:PD.Type up to 200 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGSVRAUTE/USRID'.User ID (USRID)
:P.The user ID for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*USRPRF:EPK.
:PD.The value of the user profile the job runs under.
:PT.:PV.character-value:EPV.
:PD.Type up to 1000 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGSVRAUTE/PASSWORD'.User password (PASSWORD)
:P.The password.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:PT.:PV.character-value:EPV.
:PD.Type up to 128 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=RMVSVRAUTE.Remove Server Auth Entry (RMVSVRAUTE)
:P.Use the Remove Server Auth Entry (RMVSVRAUTE) command to remove a
profile's entry for a remote server.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='RMVSVRAUTE/USRPRF'.User profile (USRPRF)
:P.The user profile the command uses.
:P.A value is required.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK.*CURRENT:EPK.
:PD.The current one.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='RMVSVRAUTE/SERVER'.Server (SERVER)
:P.The server for this command.
:P.A value is required.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.character-value:EPV.
:PD.Type up to 200 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
